+# usage: qv_ab.sh <gpu> <A dir> <B dir> <metrics> [reps] [rounds]  (GPU box) ABBA of two model dirs, each arm one exclusive-lock session (retries while another server runs); appends to ~/inkling/optQV/ab_log.jsonl
